<title>USA: Provident to buy Information Leasing Corp.</title>
<headline>Provident to buy Information Leasing Corp.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI, Ohio 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Provident Bancorp said on Monday it entered into a definitive agreement to buy Information Leasing Corp and its affiliated leasing services company for about $31 million, mostly in common stock.  </p>
<p>Provident said the transaction, which was subject to certain conditions, would be accretive to earnings immediately.</p>
<p>Information Leasing is a full-service equipment-leasing company.</p>
